ent-ActionHereticBurglarsFinesse = Burglar's Finesse
    .desc = Pull a random item out of the target's backpack straight into your hand.
ent-ActionHereticCaretakersRefuge = Caretaker's Last Refuge
    .desc = Slip out of your body as a translucent haze. You cannot act while inside, and other minds nearby prevent the escape.
ent-ActionHereticLabyrinthBarrier = Labyrinth Barrier
    .desc = Materialize a barrier of pages. Only stewards and servants of the Labyrinth can walk through it. The handbook has 5 charges which regenerate over time.
ent-ActionHereticLockAscendedShapeshift = Ascended Shapechange
    .desc = Take on the form of an eldritch creature of the Labyrinth, gaining its abilities. If your form dies, you do not.
